WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.040
Well, so I would like to.

00:01.740 --> 00:04.220
I bet you would like to, but that doesn't mean you're going to. Are you?

00:04.520 --> 00:09.560
No, no, no. What I'm saying to you is the Congress has statutes on seditious conspiracy,

00:10.100 --> 00:13.200
on insurrection, on impeding federal law enforcement.

00:13.700 --> 00:18.400
The domestic terrorism statute in Congress obviously needs to be strengthened for domestic terrorism in Congress.

00:18.480 --> 00:19.720
We have foreign terrorism charges.

00:19.720 --> 00:22.040
We have an entire patchwork of federal laws.

00:22.580 --> 00:26.520
To the extent that there are charges that apply, we will charge them in every single case.

00:26.520 --> 00:29.160
You have impeding law enforcement. You have seditious conspiracy.

00:29.380 --> 00:30.720
You have a conspiracy to the private rights.

00:31.100 --> 00:32.900
You have assault against law enforcement officers.

00:33.380 --> 00:38.020
But all of this meets the hallmark textbook definitions of domestic terrorism.

00:38.540 --> 00:43.480
I just want, Boris, I just want you just for a moment to step back and think about what we're talking about here.

00:43.860 --> 00:47.540
We, President Trump ran and won a campaign on turning back the border invasion.

00:47.860 --> 00:49.460
You've said that several times, Stephen.

00:49.460 --> 00:51.580
We have a limited amount of time, so let me ask you.

00:51.880 --> 00:53.160
Let me ask you about the governor of Illinois.

00:53.160 --> 00:56.480
Peter is going to be a no-go zone for ICE.

00:56.480 --> 00:58.120
How is that not insurrection?

00:58.260 --> 01:01.620
Stephen, Stephen, we're set to hear from J.B. Pritzker in just moments.

01:01.860 --> 01:06.140
He says that you're attempting to inflame tensions and create a war zone.

01:06.340 --> 01:10.820
He also says that you are profiling, that you're targeting black and brown people,

01:11.180 --> 01:13.400
even those who turn out to be here legally.

01:13.680 --> 01:14.760
What's your response?

01:14.760 --> 01:44.740
Thank you.

